<title>ITALY: Gross yield falls at Italy CCT auction.</title>
<headline>Gross yield falls at Italy CCT auction.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Auction results for a fifth tranche of 1.5 trillion lire of seven-year Italian Treasury floating rate certificates (CCTs) paying a first coupon of 4.55 percent.</p>
<p>		   Sept 1, 2003 CCT	 pvs</p>
<p>    Net Yield	   7.03 pct	 7.44</p>
<p>    Gross yield	 8.10 pct	 8.56</p>
<p>    Assigned price    101.65	 101.30</p>
<p>    Total bids	  7.653 trillion lire</p>
<p>    Assigned	    1.500 trillion lire</p>
<p>The last CCT auction was of a third tranche of Sept 1, 2003 certificates on September 27.</p>
</text>
